      "disposition": "mitigated-on-supported-S3-path",
      "reason": "Exact installed S3 client explicitly selects system roots, passes 16 offline negative chains plus Amazon root, rejects all 14 live compromised-key hosts, accepts two valid controls, and passes real S3 PUT/GET/412. No global CPython or botocore backport is claimed.",
